Spend climbed from January to a peak in the spring, then fell off. The data is a snapshot taken on 2025-06-30, so 2025 only runs January to June, and June is a partial month. It covers all four source systems (SAP, Oracle, Baan and Workday). Amounts are shown in their original currency and are not converted between USD, EUR and GBP.

- **USD:** Spend rose from 68,700.00 in January to a peak of 290,200.00 in April. It then dropped to 132,750.00 in May and 79,900.00 in June.
- **EUR:** Spend peaked in March at 140,500.75 and has eased each month since, down to 29,800.00 in June.
- **GBP:** Monthly spend was small and uneven: 13,600.00 to 38,900.00 in the months it appears. There were no GBP invoices in January or June.
- **Invoice volume:** The busiest months were February to May, with 10 to 11 invoices each. January had 5 and June had 3.


